  "label": "Men are pigs stereotype",
  "description": "A derogatory stereotype that equates men with pigs, implying inherent brutishness, animalistic behavior, and lack of refinement. This stereotype is used to demean and insult men by reducing them to their supposed base instincts, often in a misogynistic context. It is a form of gender-based discrimination and is considered hateful generalization.",
